      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Nightmares & Dreams</b>


    Each world first appears through a dark nightmare filter. Every nightmare hides its own way out, and running from a fear is rarely it. Find the way, and the filter lifts to show the world as it really is.


    Then follow the floating lights back to where you started: a portal home will be waiting.'
